The tag key cannot be an empty string. The tag key can be up to 64 characters in length, and cannot start with aliyun or acs:, or contain http:// or https://.', example='TestKey'),
      value?: string(name='Value', description='The value of tag N that is added to the command. Valid values of N: 1 to 20.

